WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.477 --> 00:00:04.912
Good morning.

00:00:04.979 --> 00:00:08.315
You are watching Netflix's anime stage.

00:00:08.382 --> 00:00:11.685
We returned to the stage of AnimeJapan after two years.

00:00:11.752 --> 00:00:13.087
The first RED STAGE is

00:00:13.153 --> 00:00:17.558
Netflix Anime Mega-rich stage in AnimeJapan 2021,

00:00:17.625 --> 00:00:19.326
and I'm your host today,

00:00:19.393 --> 00:00:22.997
NHK announcer, Hisanori Yoshida. Nice to meet you.

00:00:23.063 --> 00:00:27.001
First, it's Netflix Anime's latest information. There really is a lot.

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:28.869
We have Netflix's Anime Chief Producer,

00:00:28.936 --> 00:00:31.238
Mr. Taiki Sakurai, to share it with us.

00:00:31.305 --> 00:00:33.741
A great lineup of guest will come in the second half,

00:00:33.807 --> 00:00:35.643
so please stay tuned.

00:00:35.709 --> 00:00:37.912
Mr. Sakurai, thanks for coming today.

00:00:37.978 --> 00:00:39.547
-Looking forward.
-Okay.

00:00:39.613 --> 00:00:43.217
About the one-minute promo video just now,

00:00:43.284 --> 00:00:47.755
there were so many anime featured that I even lost count.

00:00:47.821 --> 00:00:53.093
A huge number of anime will be streamed on Netflix in 2021, right?

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:58.766
Yes, actually, this year, there will be about 40…

00:00:59.466 --> 00:01:02.336
Netflix Original Anime streamed.

00:01:02.403 --> 00:01:05.506
It's double the number of last year's?

00:01:05.573 --> 00:01:09.310
That's right. The number of anime is double of last year's,

00:01:10.044 --> 00:01:13.814
every week… Considering there are 12 months in a year,

00:01:14.582 --> 00:01:17.017
we have 48 anime streamed every week.

00:01:17.084 --> 00:01:18.619
Oh, it's almost like that?

00:01:18.686 --> 00:01:19.920
It's like that.

00:01:19.987 --> 00:01:21.856
Every week, not one after next,

00:01:21.922 --> 00:01:24.825
a whole series is streamed and there are 40.

00:01:24.892 --> 00:01:29.864
In terms of episodes, there probably are hundreds of them

00:01:29.930 --> 00:01:32.333
streamed on Netflix this year, right?

00:01:32.399 --> 00:01:33.434
That's right.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:38.038
This time, I've already been told to hurry up at this point.

00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:41.008
That's right, we'll introduce the featured anime on Netflix.

00:01:41.075 --> 00:01:43.944
Among them, we'll first introduce three anime

00:01:44.011 --> 00:01:45.746
-with Mr. Sakurai.
-Thank you.

00:01:45.813 --> 00:01:50.584
First, these two featured anime are two brand new series.

00:01:50.651 --> 00:01:52.019
The first one is

00:01:52.086 --> 00:01:55.823
Yasuke, which got everyone talking after its still picture was released.

00:01:56.824 --> 00:01:58.025
This is the anime.

00:01:58.792 --> 00:02:01.495
Today, the character designer Mr. Takeshi Koike,

00:02:01.562 --> 00:02:03.998
has finished its special artwork.

00:02:04.064 --> 00:02:05.466
Please have a look.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:12.573
Yes, this key visual is an impressive one.

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:14.408
What do you think, Mr. Sakurai?

00:02:14.475 --> 00:02:18.445
Every part is so expressive, I am speechless.

00:02:18.512 --> 00:02:20.381
Yes, speaking of Mr. Koike,

00:02:20.447 --> 00:02:23.050
people who like anime, especially anime movies,

00:02:23.117 --> 00:02:27.254
I think many of them can't look away from Mr. Koike's works.

00:02:27.755 --> 00:02:30.424
Mr. Koike designed the characters,

00:02:30.491 --> 00:02:32.326
and the world expressed here is

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:38.199
an age of warring states with robots and magic mixed together.

00:02:38.265 --> 00:02:40.768
To protect Saki, a girl who has a mysterious power,

00:02:40.834 --> 00:02:42.469
from evil forces,

00:02:42.536 --> 00:02:45.339
Samurai Yasuke picks up his sword again to fight the evil.

00:02:45.406 --> 00:02:51.011
This fantasy period drama is produced
by Mr. LeSean Thomas and MAPPA.

00:02:51.512 --> 00:02:54.682
Like Mr. Koike, Mr. LeSean Thomas has also

00:02:54.748 --> 00:02:58.219
produced some pop anime for Netflix so far.

00:02:58.285 --> 00:03:00.988
I think he is a very talented person.

00:03:01.055 --> 00:03:03.023
He just loves anime,

00:03:03.090 --> 00:03:04.758
and he has moved to Japan.

00:03:04.825 --> 00:03:07.595
-Oh, has he?
-Yes, he lives in Japan.

00:03:07.661 --> 00:03:12.132
He does this to be a producer here.

00:03:12.199 --> 00:03:16.170
He spends a lot of time on it, like he stays at MAPPA all the time.

00:03:16.237 --> 00:03:17.738
Also, speaking of MAPPA,

00:03:17.805 --> 00:03:21.775
anime fans in Japan know the quality of their work is high,

00:03:21.842 --> 00:03:24.144
and everybody knows the studio.

00:03:24.211 --> 00:03:28.749
Obviously, MAPPA is a Japanese animation studio.

00:03:28.816 --> 00:03:32.953
If Mr. LeSean Thomas has moved to Japan,

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.056
will he communicate, in English basically?

00:03:36.123 --> 00:03:39.226
Yes, he loves Japan and anime, but he can't speak Japanese.

00:03:39.293 --> 00:03:40.895
-Is that so?
-Yes.

00:03:41.562 --> 00:03:44.265
That's why when we first go to talk to MAPPA,

00:03:44.331 --> 00:03:46.066
we said if possible,

00:03:46.133 --> 00:03:50.204
we'd like LeSean to be the producer, but he couldn't speak Japanese.

00:03:50.271 --> 00:03:52.540
-You went to talk to them?
-Yes, I did.

00:03:52.606 --> 00:03:54.174
When I told Mr. Otsuka…

00:03:54.241 --> 00:03:56.010
-Their CEO.
-Yes, the CEO, Mr. Otsuka.

00:03:56.076 --> 00:03:58.579
-He said it was quite interesting.
-What?

00:03:58.646 --> 00:04:00.881
He said it was interesting instead?

00:04:00.948 --> 00:04:02.750
Yes, because it wasn't done before.

00:04:03.317 --> 00:04:06.387
He said it's good the producer didn't speak the same language.

00:04:06.453 --> 00:04:09.557
Then, of course Jake acted as our interpreter,

00:04:09.623 --> 00:04:11.358
he's our unsung hero too.

00:04:11.859 --> 00:04:16.797
Something difficult like that is also interesting,

00:04:16.864 --> 00:04:18.699
and they see it as a challenge.

00:04:19.166 --> 00:04:21.202
MAPPA has a spirit like that,

00:04:21.268 --> 00:04:26.240
I think it's the motivation that makes them unstoppable like this.

00:04:26.307 --> 00:04:27.975
This just occurred to me,

00:04:28.042 --> 00:04:32.913
that if the original series is created by Netflix,
the whole world can watch it.

00:04:32.980 --> 00:04:38.118
Part of it makes me feel that animation
is borderless in the first place.

00:04:38.185 --> 00:04:39.520
-That's right.
-Yes.

00:04:39.587 --> 00:04:41.922
So, about Yasuke.

00:04:41.989 --> 00:04:43.157
It's brand new,

00:04:43.224 --> 00:04:48.329
so I think viewers can enjoy both its character design and its world.

00:04:48.395 --> 00:04:50.798
Netflix's original anime series Yasuke

00:04:50.865 --> 00:04:55.469
will premier April 29 worldwide exclusively on Netflix.

00:04:55.536 --> 00:04:57.805
The implication sounds even more profound.

00:04:57.872 --> 00:05:02.543
Then, the next one, Eden, is also a brand new series.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:06.881
The date of streaming has also been scheduled.

00:05:07.348 --> 00:05:10.351
Eden is a sci-fi fantasy, which talks about how Sara,

00:05:10.451 --> 00:05:13.187
a girl raised by two robots, stands against the world.

00:05:13.687 --> 00:05:16.891
We have the latest video released today,

00:05:16.957 --> 00:05:18.125
let's watch it now.

00:05:20.694 --> 00:05:22.363
Human language.

00:05:23.297 --> 00:05:25.032
There is a human in this world.

00:05:26.233 --> 00:05:27.968
What would you like to do?

00:05:29.036 --> 00:05:30.738
Eliminate them.

00:05:32.239 --> 00:05:34.975
No one must know there is a human here.

00:05:35.843 --> 00:05:38.646
Humans are considered to be bad.

00:05:38.712 --> 00:05:39.713
Sara!

00:05:41.715 --> 00:05:44.051
Did the recon squad find out about this place?

00:05:45.486 --> 00:05:46.887
What are you going to do?

00:05:48.489 --> 00:05:49.390
Stop Zero!

00:05:50.624 --> 00:05:53.160
Zero, are you fully recharged?

00:05:55.329 --> 00:05:57.965
Humans will destroy the world.

00:05:58.566 --> 00:05:59.733
They are evil.

00:06:03.037 --> 00:06:04.672
Humans are not harmful!

00:06:06.307 --> 00:06:08.475
Sara is a very good human.

00:06:09.577 --> 00:06:10.444
Stop!

00:06:11.545 --> 00:06:14.915
Why do you hate humans so much?

00:06:16.317 --> 00:06:18.986
To create a perfect world,

00:06:20.187 --> 00:06:22.423
humans are a hindrance.

00:06:22.489 --> 00:06:23.791
It can't be…

00:06:30.497 --> 00:06:36.303
Part of the anime is cute and part of it is serious.

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:43.110
Yes, the story is about Sara from her childhood till she grows up.

00:06:43.577 --> 00:06:45.045
You'll see various sides of her.

00:06:45.112 --> 00:06:47.715
Okay, when we talked about Yasuke just now,

00:06:47.781 --> 00:06:51.085
we said the production team was international,

00:06:51.151 --> 00:06:53.487
but Eden's is even more international.

00:06:54.088 --> 00:07:00.895
Yes, producer Justin was my colleague
when I worked at Production IG.

00:07:00.961 --> 00:07:03.898
This is a project he wanted to do at that time,

00:07:04.465 --> 00:07:08.969
so we thought we might as well do it, and started it.

00:07:09.036 --> 00:07:11.705
-Justin is a dreamer…
-I see.

00:07:11.772 --> 00:07:14.875
He thought if he gathered the most talented people from the world,

00:07:15.376 --> 00:07:17.578
then he could create the best work.

00:07:17.645 --> 00:07:20.281
So we got Taiwan's animation studio,

00:07:20.347 --> 00:07:21.916
China's art company,

00:07:21.982 --> 00:07:23.784
music composer from Australia…

00:07:23.851 --> 00:07:26.153
We gathered them one by one.

00:07:26.220 --> 00:07:28.989
That's how the team was formed.

00:07:29.056 --> 00:07:32.593
This must be a project structure that is only possible nowadays.

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:35.129
Actually, after this,

00:07:35.196 --> 00:07:39.333
Miss Marika Kohno, who plays Sara,
will come as a guest and talk to us,

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:41.535
and we'll talk about it again later.

00:07:41.602 --> 00:07:44.238
Netflix Original Anime Series, Eden,

00:07:44.305 --> 00:07:47.775
will premier May 27 worldwide exclusively on Netflix.

00:07:48.209 --> 00:07:51.612
Now, I'll introduce one more anime with Mr. Sakurai.

00:07:51.679 --> 00:07:55.115
Let's first watch its promo video, which is first released today.

00:07:56.984 --> 00:07:59.019
Thirteen one-on-one matches

00:07:59.086 --> 00:08:02.289
between gods and men will take place

00:08:02.356 --> 00:08:03.524
in what is called

00:08:03.591 --> 00:08:04.925
"Ragnarok."

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:08.696
You wish not to stand in the same ring as me?

00:08:08.762 --> 00:08:10.364
Are you perhaps

00:08:11.265 --> 00:08:14.168
scared?

00:08:17.838 --> 00:08:21.609
There is no one in this world who can rival me!

00:08:21.675 --> 00:08:22.943
I have one request.

00:08:23.010 --> 00:08:24.278
Do not die.

00:08:24.345 --> 00:08:27.982
You're a nasty one, aren't you?

00:08:28.415 --> 00:08:30.851
Don't look at me, you perverted old man.

00:08:32.553 --> 00:08:35.155
For the first time in millennia, my blood is running hot.

00:08:35.222 --> 00:08:37.324
I'm getting excited.

00:08:37.391 --> 00:08:39.293
File number one.

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:40.261
It's sour.

00:08:40.861 --> 00:08:43.998
Ganryu is still evolving.

00:08:45.332 --> 00:08:46.634
Sounds like fun.

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:48.802
I'm so jealous of that human.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:51.338
This is a fight for the soul.

00:08:52.740 --> 00:08:53.974
Crush him.

00:08:55.142 --> 00:08:56.110
They're all trash.

00:09:18.666 --> 00:09:21.135
Wow, it makes me excited!

00:09:21.202 --> 00:09:22.836
-It's great.
-It's great, right?

00:09:22.903 --> 00:09:25.839
The manga series started in 2018 in Monthly Comic Zenon,

00:09:25.906 --> 00:09:29.009
over six million copies of the popular manga were sold

00:09:29.076 --> 00:09:30.444
and it's finally animated.

00:09:30.511 --> 00:09:34.648
The world's god representatives
fight against human representatives

00:09:34.715 --> 00:09:37.051
in 13 one-on-one matches to decide humanity's fate,

00:09:37.117 --> 00:09:38.385
in the battle action anime.

00:09:38.452 --> 00:09:41.388
How can you not be excited?

00:09:41.455 --> 00:09:43.557
The cast is amazing as well.

00:09:43.624 --> 00:09:45.159
It's a great lineup.

00:09:45.226 --> 00:09:48.262
The protagonist, who proposed to hold the matches,

00:09:48.329 --> 00:09:51.932
is the eldest of 13 Valkyrie siblings… well, sisters.

00:09:51.999 --> 00:09:54.335
Not just Ms. Miyuki Sawashiro, who plays Brunhilde,

00:09:54.401 --> 00:09:58.339
many people will go, "Wow!" when they see the names of the cast.

00:09:58.405 --> 00:10:01.141
It's like one-to-one matches between Japan's voice actors.

00:10:01.208 --> 00:10:05.045
In Warner Bros. Japan Anime's live streaming held on March 28,

00:10:05.112 --> 00:10:08.215
Ms. Miyuki Sawashiro,
Mr. Tomokazu Seki and Mr. Hikaru Midorikawa

00:10:08.282 --> 00:10:12.419
talked about Record of Ragnarok's appeal
and streaming information.

00:10:12.486 --> 00:10:15.089
For more details, please check out

00:10:15.155 --> 00:10:19.326
Warner Bros. Japan Anime's official twitter.

00:10:19.393 --> 00:10:20.828
Anyway, Mr. Sakurai,

00:10:20.895 --> 00:10:24.098
Netflix really loves producing pure martial arts anime,

00:10:24.164 --> 00:10:26.467
like Baki and Kengan Ashura.

00:10:27.067 --> 00:10:29.870
-They are really popular.
-Is that so?

00:10:29.937 --> 00:10:32.039
They are very popular.

00:10:32.106 --> 00:10:38.112
That's why we'd like to produce anime
packed with action in the future too.

00:10:38.179 --> 00:10:40.447
Like The Witcher, Spriggan,

00:10:40.514 --> 00:10:44.518
we have lots of action-packed anime coming up in the future,

00:10:44.585 --> 00:10:46.253
please look forward to it.

00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:49.857
On the other hand, Netflix also produces cute anime like Aggretsuko,

00:10:49.924 --> 00:10:51.525
there are actually a lot.

00:10:51.592 --> 00:10:53.394
We want to make cute ones too.

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:57.231
Okay, we've got a large variety of anime, so please look forward.

00:10:57.298 --> 00:11:00.467
Netflix Original Anime Series, Record of Ragnarok

00:11:00.534 --> 00:11:03.437
will premier in June worldwide only on Netflix.

00:11:03.504 --> 00:11:07.575
That concludes the introduction of Netflix's featured anime.

00:11:07.641 --> 00:11:10.878
Mr. Sakurai will leave the stage for now,

00:11:10.945 --> 00:11:12.847
and our other guests will come on stage.

00:11:12.913 --> 00:11:14.815
-Thank you, Mr. Sakurai.
-Thank you.

00:11:14.882 --> 00:11:16.083
Thank you.

00:11:18.452 --> 00:11:20.221
Okay, thank you for your patience.

00:11:20.287 --> 00:11:25.893
Next, let's welcome the main actors
from Netflix's featured original anime

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.596
and interview them about the highlight of the anime.

00:11:28.662 --> 00:11:30.865
Please let me introduce our guests.

00:11:30.931 --> 00:11:32.399
First, it is this gentleman.

00:11:32.466 --> 00:11:34.034
This cozy comedy anime shows

00:11:34.101 --> 00:11:37.938
the daily life of a legendary ex-yakuza,
who lives as a househusband.

00:11:38.005 --> 00:11:40.474
Playing protagonist Tatsu in The Way of the Househusband,

00:11:40.541 --> 00:11:41.775
Mr. Kenjiro Tsuda.

00:11:42.776 --> 00:11:46.714
Hello, I am Kenjiro Tsuda. I play the Immortal Dragon, Tatsu.

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.115
Nice to meet you.

00:11:48.182 --> 00:11:51.352
The key visual of the anime next to you is impressive.

00:11:51.418 --> 00:11:53.521
-It's strong.
-It's strong.

00:11:53.587 --> 00:11:55.089
-Nice to meet you.
-Same here.

00:11:55.623 --> 00:11:57.758
Next, a girl raised by two robots

00:11:57.825 --> 00:12:00.160
stands against the world in the sci-fi fantasy.

00:12:00.227 --> 00:12:03.531
This is Miss Marika Kohno who plays the protagonist Sara in Eden.

00:12:04.064 --> 00:12:06.500
Hello, I play Sara in Eden.

00:12:06.567 --> 00:12:09.370
I am Marika Kohno. Thanks for having me today.

00:12:09.436 --> 00:12:10.271
Nice to meet you.

00:12:10.337 --> 00:12:13.507
The key visual is totally different from The Way of the Househusband.

00:12:13.574 --> 00:12:15.910
Yes, it is a precious one.

00:12:15.976 --> 00:12:18.145
Yes, the little girl in the middle is Sara?

00:12:18.212 --> 00:12:19.914
Yes, it is her.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:20.915
Next.

00:12:21.815 --> 00:12:23.651
Zombies appear in the White House.

00:12:23.717 --> 00:12:25.486
Expect the largest scale ever seen

00:12:25.553 --> 00:12:29.757
from the first serial CG drama of the RESIDENT EVIL series,

00:12:29.823 --> 00:12:31.992
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness.

00:12:32.059 --> 00:12:34.862
Playing the protagonist, Leon, is Mr. Toshiyuki Morikawa.

00:12:35.462 --> 00:12:37.998
Yes, everyone. Good morning.

00:12:38.666 --> 00:12:42.369
I am Toshiyuki Morikawa, and I play Leon. Nice to meet you.

00:12:42.436 --> 00:12:43.504
Nice to meet you.

00:12:43.571 --> 00:12:46.006
It is that RESIDENT EVIL series.

00:12:46.073 --> 00:12:49.276
On top of that, it is a serial CG drama.

00:12:49.343 --> 00:12:51.011
Yes, it's the first one.

00:12:51.078 --> 00:12:53.214
Yes, I can't contain my excitement,

00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:56.083
but let's talk about each anime now.

00:12:56.150 --> 00:12:59.553
We'll start from Mr. Kenjiro Tsuda's The Way of the Househusband.

00:12:59.620 --> 00:13:00.888
Okay.

00:13:00.955 --> 00:13:03.490
First, the promo video is released,

00:13:03.557 --> 00:13:05.726
and it's already very funny.

00:13:05.793 --> 00:13:08.262
-Thank you.
-We'd like to show you that.

00:13:08.329 --> 00:13:10.097
Please watch the trailer of the anime.

00:13:12.199 --> 00:13:13.400
Once,

00:13:13.467 --> 00:13:16.203
there was a legendary yakuza,

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:17.872
feared in the world of organized crime.

00:13:18.672 --> 00:13:20.274
The Immortal Dragon.

00:13:20.975 --> 00:13:22.676
However, one day,

00:13:22.743 --> 00:13:26.680
the man vanished without a trace and is now…

00:13:27.481 --> 00:13:28.415
Occupation?

00:13:29.149 --> 00:13:30.885
Full-time househusband.

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.525
For the family I love,

00:13:38.492 --> 00:13:40.928
I will weather the Way of the Househusband!

00:13:40.995 --> 00:13:44.632
This is uncut, 100 percent hand-sewn.

00:13:44.698 --> 00:13:45.733
Come on, just buy it.

00:13:46.100 --> 00:13:48.536
I won't buy you games if you act like a spoiled brat!

00:13:50.504 --> 00:13:52.039
Hamburger meal.

00:13:52.106 --> 00:13:54.608
Don't you know light and dark laundry doesn't mix!

00:13:54.675 --> 00:13:56.577
Don't mess with color transfer!

00:13:57.311 --> 00:13:59.947
Why aren't you attacking the corner?

00:14:00.014 --> 00:14:00.948
Boss!

00:14:01.015 --> 00:14:02.249
Huh?

00:14:03.417 --> 00:14:05.219
Why'd you quit being a yakuza?

00:14:09.323 --> 00:14:10.491
Hey!

00:14:10.558 --> 00:14:13.594
I'm going to protect my own in my own way.

00:14:14.562 --> 00:14:17.231
You forgot your lunch!

00:14:17.298 --> 00:14:19.833
Daily chores just became a little more fun

00:14:19.900 --> 00:14:21.769
in this cozy comedy

00:14:21.835 --> 00:14:24.104
exclusively available on NETFLIX.

00:14:24.972 --> 00:14:29.276
NETFLIX is seriously raking in the dough.

00:14:32.246 --> 00:14:33.714
The Way of the Househusband.

00:14:34.215 --> 00:14:37.451
I'll pay whatever it takes. Just prepare the goods.

00:14:37.518 --> 00:14:39.620
Also, could you make a point card for me?

00:14:44.658 --> 00:14:46.927
After you watch the promo video…

00:14:46.994 --> 00:14:50.197
First, Miss Kohno and Mr. Morikawa,
who also watched it, are laughing.

00:14:51.165 --> 00:14:53.133
-I'm very happy.
-It's amazing!

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:56.570
It even gets the client, Netflix, involved.

00:14:56.637 --> 00:14:58.205
-Yes.
-I've never seen that before.

00:14:58.272 --> 00:15:01.008
"It's raking the dough."

00:15:01.075 --> 00:15:03.477
Everything is different from its appearance.

00:15:03.544 --> 00:15:04.512
It's attractive.

00:15:04.578 --> 00:15:07.014
-Yes!
-Tatsu is cute, indeed, isn't he?

00:15:07.081 --> 00:15:09.083
He is cute!

00:15:09.149 --> 00:15:11.852
The moment I saw him making the character lunch box,

00:15:11.919 --> 00:15:14.121
I thought, I wanted a dad like him.

00:15:14.188 --> 00:15:15.422
Want a dad like him?

00:15:15.489 --> 00:15:18.158
-I want a dad like him!
-You want a dad like him?

00:15:18.225 --> 00:15:19.426
I do!

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:22.596
He does chores at home properly.

00:15:22.663 --> 00:15:24.064
He does them perfectly.

00:15:24.131 --> 00:15:27.167
-He is an accepting person.
-Yes, indeed.

00:15:27.234 --> 00:15:31.872
This key visual too, it's a gangster and a character lunch box.

00:15:31.939 --> 00:15:34.508
-Yes.
-That's what the character is like.

00:15:34.575 --> 00:15:39.046
The original manga of this anime is very popular to begin with.

00:15:39.113 --> 00:15:42.583
I looked up who the producer is, it's Ms. Chiaki Kon.

00:15:42.650 --> 00:15:44.919
-Yes, it's her.
-Like Nodame Cantabile…

00:15:45.386 --> 00:15:51.492
Nobody can make gags in daily life funnier than Ms. Kon.

00:15:51.559 --> 00:15:54.562
J.C.STAFF does the animation production,

00:15:54.628 --> 00:15:58.832
so there's a huge gap between its scariness and its cuteness,

00:15:58.899 --> 00:16:00.234
-I think.
-Yes.

00:16:00.301 --> 00:16:02.403
First, as a viewer, Mr. Tsuda,

00:16:02.469 --> 00:16:04.238
I assume you've watched part of it,

00:16:04.305 --> 00:16:05.472
what do you think?

00:16:05.539 --> 00:16:08.309
-It is extremely funny.
-Yes.

00:16:08.375 --> 00:16:11.712
It made me excited even when I watched it just now.

00:16:11.779 --> 00:16:13.214
It really is stupid.

00:16:13.848 --> 00:16:15.616
It is so stupid,

00:16:15.683 --> 00:16:19.119
but there are many things you can learn from it.

00:16:19.186 --> 00:16:22.723
-Learn from it?
-Things that are common for househusbands.

00:16:22.790 --> 00:16:25.559
When you do the laundry,

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:30.898
he goes, "You use this drug… this white powder?"

00:16:30.965 --> 00:16:34.902
-He says "white powder" in that voice?
-Yes, that's right.

00:16:34.969 --> 00:16:39.306
But he does tell you things useful for…

00:16:39.773 --> 00:16:40.841
househusbands…

00:16:40.908 --> 00:16:44.712
-Tips?
-There are many tips in the anime.

00:16:44.778 --> 00:16:46.647
It's useful in that sense.

00:16:47.181 --> 00:16:49.783
Yes. But Mr. Tsuda, you've originally

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.620
done the promo video of the original manga series,

00:16:52.686 --> 00:16:55.923
and a live action version of it.
You've been playing Tatsu for a while.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:59.426
Yes, I've been involved in various pieces of work.

00:16:59.493 --> 00:17:01.996
There must be many things about Tatsu,

00:17:02.062 --> 00:17:04.098
but what is important when you play him?

00:17:04.164 --> 00:17:05.900
Ah…

00:17:05.966 --> 00:17:08.769
He is quite a serious person, despite his looks.

00:17:08.836 --> 00:17:09.770
I see!

00:17:09.837 --> 00:17:13.541
He is very strict and serious about being a househusband.

00:17:13.607 --> 00:17:15.743
I guess it's the gap between them.

00:17:15.809 --> 00:17:18.012
The gap, as Miss Kohno said.

00:17:18.078 --> 00:17:20.748
-The gap is really…
-It's a huge difference.

00:17:20.814 --> 00:17:23.984
You can see how interesting it is everywhere.

00:17:24.051 --> 00:17:27.121
And if he intimidates you in Kansai dialect,

00:17:27.188 --> 00:17:28.822
-it startles you at first.
-Yes.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.759
Mr. Tsuda, you came from the Kansai region…

00:17:31.825 --> 00:17:32.793
Yes, from Osaka.

00:17:32.860 --> 00:17:36.197
What do you think about the language Tatsu speaks?

00:17:36.263 --> 00:17:42.336
Well, you can see the power of his Kansai dialect everywhere

00:17:42.403 --> 00:17:44.004
in the anime,

00:17:45.005 --> 00:17:47.908
like the very localized "don't be a chicken."

00:17:48.742 --> 00:17:51.912
There are words you don't hear often too.

00:17:51.979 --> 00:17:56.817
But when I talked to the manga artist of the original manga series,

00:17:56.884 --> 00:18:01.622
he also lets Tatsu say many things that aren't Kansai dialect,

00:18:01.689 --> 00:18:04.191
so it's like the series' own Kansai dialect.

00:18:04.258 --> 00:18:06.160
Its own Kansai dialect? A new language?

00:18:06.227 --> 00:18:09.230
Yes, it's Kansai dialect in the Way of the Househusband's world.

00:18:09.296 --> 00:18:13.367
But everyone laughed very hard when we recorded it,

00:18:13.434 --> 00:18:14.869
and we had a lot of fun.

00:18:14.935 --> 00:18:18.138
Yes, it must've been hard for you to contain your laughter.

00:18:18.205 --> 00:18:20.040
We said we could do it forever.

00:18:20.107 --> 00:18:22.076
-Forever? Because it's so much fun?
-Yes.

00:18:22.142 --> 00:18:25.412
-You want to stay in its world forever?
-Yes, it's really enjoyable.

00:18:25.479 --> 00:18:26.680
It's coming soon.

00:18:26.747 --> 00:18:29.650
Netflix Original Anime Series The Way of the Househusband

00:18:29.717 --> 00:18:33.387
premiers April 8 worldwide exclusively on Netflix.

00:18:33.454 --> 00:18:35.022
I wonder how the world will react.

00:18:35.089 --> 00:18:36.657
-Exactly!
-Really.

00:18:36.724 --> 00:18:39.493
When I filmed the live action promo video,

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:42.763
I directed it and played the main character.

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.967
There were many comments left by people overseas.

00:18:47.034 --> 00:18:48.002
Wow!

00:18:48.068 --> 00:18:50.771
In a very traditional English dictionary,

00:18:50.838 --> 00:18:53.107
-the word "yakuza" is there as it is.
-Yes.

00:18:53.173 --> 00:18:56.844
-This must be a style unique to Japan.
-Yes.

00:18:56.911 --> 00:18:58.646
It is a comedy like this.

00:18:58.712 --> 00:19:00.681
-Please look forward to it.
-Thank you.

00:19:00.748 --> 00:19:02.850
Next, I'd like to move on to Eden,

00:19:02.917 --> 00:19:05.586
which features Miss Marika Kohno as the protagonist.

00:19:05.653 --> 00:19:06.654
Okay.

00:19:06.720 --> 00:19:10.591
This is an anime you had spent a long time working on,

00:19:10.658 --> 00:19:13.661
you did a so-called prescoring once, didn't you?

00:19:13.727 --> 00:19:18.432
That's right. It's a new anime without an original story,

00:19:18.499 --> 00:19:22.937
so we recorded our lines for them to make the animation.

00:19:23.003 --> 00:19:28.309
We recorded our lines without any picture,

00:19:28.375 --> 00:19:30.110
in the form of prescoring.

00:19:30.177 --> 00:19:32.780
You recorded it properly again after it's polished.

00:19:32.847 --> 00:19:36.784
That's right. We recorded the same scene again and again,

00:19:36.851 --> 00:19:41.188
the CG of the drawings was being finished gradually,

00:19:41.255 --> 00:19:43.224
and we've been watching it together.

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:46.493
The anime was made in such an elaborate way,

00:19:46.560 --> 00:19:48.395
so we'll watch the video…

00:19:48.462 --> 00:19:51.332
It's an existing video, so please say whatever you think.

00:19:51.398 --> 00:19:53.067
Sure!

00:19:53.133 --> 00:19:54.668
Please have a look at the video.

00:19:57.338 --> 00:20:00.674
Mr. Sakurai said a company in China drew the background,

00:20:00.741 --> 00:20:04.778
its texture is a bit different from the artwork of Japan.

00:20:04.845 --> 00:20:06.280
That's right.

00:20:06.347 --> 00:20:08.115
When I saw the colored drawings,

00:20:08.182 --> 00:20:11.585
I thought they were drawn in quite a pop way.

00:20:12.219 --> 00:20:16.223
And Sara. This is the character you play, Miss Kohno?

00:20:16.290 --> 00:20:17.391
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:20:18.692 --> 00:20:22.196
The movement of the CG is very vivid.

00:20:22.263 --> 00:20:24.098
It is stylish.

00:20:25.666 --> 00:20:27.801
Even when I read the script,

00:20:27.868 --> 00:20:31.338
I already thought the character moved a lot.

00:20:31.405 --> 00:20:36.377
You can see moments when her facial expressions change in CG,

00:20:36.443 --> 00:20:37.478
so I'm happy.

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:43.617
And Sara is the first person identified in this world for the time being.

00:20:43.684 --> 00:20:45.853
Sara is the only one.

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:48.222
That's right, in this world,

00:20:48.289 --> 00:20:50.624
Sara is the only human in this world,

00:20:50.858 --> 00:20:52.793
that's the moment the story begins.

00:20:53.561 --> 00:20:57.264
It is also a big secret of this world.

00:20:58.199 --> 00:21:00.834
An evil-looking person just showed up.

00:21:00.901 --> 00:21:02.269
Evil-looking person… robot?

00:21:02.336 --> 00:21:04.205
-Which one? Robot, right?
-It's a robot.

00:21:04.271 --> 00:21:07.308
The robot is played by Mr. Koichi Yamadera.

00:21:07.374 --> 00:21:09.677
-Yes, that's right.
-Yes.

00:21:09.743 --> 00:21:13.647
I did the recording with him.

00:21:13.714 --> 00:21:20.487
There was a scene where Mr. Yamadera's character drank something.

00:21:20.554 --> 00:21:22.723
-What? But he's a robot.
-But he's a robot.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:25.059
He's a robot,

00:21:25.125 --> 00:21:29.063
but there's a scene, where he chews a drink.

00:21:29.129 --> 00:21:30.698
I guess there's a secret

00:21:30.764 --> 00:21:32.867
-hidden in what you said.
-It's a huge secret.

00:21:32.933 --> 00:21:35.069
-Wow…
-So, about that scene…

00:21:35.135 --> 00:21:40.007
Yes, in that scene, I still…

00:21:40.074 --> 00:21:44.945
I like to observe how other voice actors do the recording,

00:21:45.012 --> 00:21:48.282
so I was watching from the back.

00:21:48.849 --> 00:21:51.852
During rehearsal,

00:21:51.919 --> 00:21:56.857
Mr. Yamadera actually poured water into his water bottle's cup,

00:21:57.658 --> 00:22:01.495
actually drank it, and sighed.

00:22:01.962 --> 00:22:06.734
He acted out the scene in the anime
before the microphone as it was.

00:22:06.800 --> 00:22:08.836
The moment I saw it, I thought,

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:12.172
"Oh, it's okay to do that?"

00:22:12.239 --> 00:22:17.444
Things that are okay to do in front of a microphone,

00:22:17.912 --> 00:22:22.716
things I can or can't do, which I can come up with,

00:22:22.783 --> 00:22:24.785
it's still difficult to draw the line.

00:22:24.852 --> 00:22:29.056
In the middle of it, when I saw him drinking water…

00:22:29.723 --> 00:22:32.059
I realized it was something allowed.

00:22:32.126 --> 00:22:36.463
Maybe it was possible only because it was Mr. Yamadera,

00:22:37.031 --> 00:22:39.266
but I thought it was wonderful.

00:22:39.333 --> 00:22:42.903
Mr. Morikawa, have you actually used drinks and stuff
when you act?

00:22:42.970 --> 00:22:44.438
-Yes, I have.
-Right?

00:22:44.505 --> 00:22:49.710
There was a scene I had to eat bread
and talk with it in my mouth.

00:22:49.777 --> 00:22:54.615
No matter how… If I don't put any bread in my mouth,

00:22:54.682 --> 00:22:55.983
it doesn't sound realistic,

00:22:56.050 --> 00:22:59.820
so I went to a convenient store to buy some bread myself,

00:23:00.588 --> 00:23:04.625
I bought several kinds of bread to do it.

00:23:04.692 --> 00:23:08.896
Wow! You put it in your mouth when you spoke, right?

00:23:08.963 --> 00:23:11.832
Did you swallow it after you spoke?

00:23:11.899 --> 00:23:13.234
What do you think I did?

00:23:15.035 --> 00:23:20.107
I swallowed it. But just that scene…

00:23:20.674 --> 00:23:22.276
I recorded it separately.

00:23:22.343 --> 00:23:26.313
I recorded another scene after I swallowed it.

00:23:26.380 --> 00:23:29.550
I see! You include so much detail when you act.

00:23:29.617 --> 00:23:32.219
Eden was made very elaborately too.

00:23:32.286 --> 00:23:33.954
-It's shown like that.
-Yes.

00:23:34.021 --> 00:23:34.922
Yes.

00:23:34.989 --> 00:23:40.060
The only human character, Sara, in Eden

00:23:40.127 --> 00:23:42.830
-is played by Miss Kohno.
-Yes.

00:23:42.897 --> 00:23:45.766
She first appeared as a baby,

00:23:45.833 --> 00:23:48.969
-did you voice the baby as well?
-I did.

00:23:49.603 --> 00:23:54.708
I played her from the moment she was born until she grew up.

00:23:55.242 --> 00:23:58.579
According to what you said,

00:23:59.246 --> 00:24:01.682
there probably is a big secret hidden in all episodes.

00:24:01.749 --> 00:24:07.988
Yes, there's a big secret in Eden, which I can't talk about yet,

00:24:08.055 --> 00:24:11.258
I hope our viewers will go on a journey with Sara.

00:24:11.325 --> 00:24:14.962
-Go on a journey with Sara, right?
-That's right.

00:24:15.029 --> 00:24:16.697
On May 27,

00:24:16.764 --> 00:24:22.736
Netflix Original Anime Series, Eden,
will premier worldwide only on Netflix.

00:24:22.803 --> 00:24:26.073
-Please look forward to it as well.
-Thank you.

00:24:26.140 --> 00:24:28.742
I'd like to move on to our last anime today.

00:24:28.809 --> 00:24:30.211
The last anime is

00:24:30.311 --> 00:24:33.180
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness.

00:24:33.247 --> 00:24:35.916
Please first have a look at this video.

00:25:34.375 --> 00:25:37.044
It is very suggestive and powerful.

00:25:37.578 --> 00:25:38.612
It is.

00:25:38.679 --> 00:25:41.849
I want to see Leon and Tatsu fight each other in a match.

00:25:43.317 --> 00:25:44.752
They both look strong.

00:25:45.553 --> 00:25:49.523
But really, this original series…

00:25:49.590 --> 00:25:52.793
I think everyone knows the title of RESIDENT EVIL,

00:25:52.860 --> 00:25:56.063
-but this is a serial CG drama.
-Yes, it is.

00:25:56.130 --> 00:25:57.798
It's the long-awaited drama.

00:25:58.332 --> 00:26:01.936
A serial drama with full CG animation.

00:26:02.469 --> 00:26:07.007
I guess people all over the world are very curious

00:26:07.074 --> 00:26:10.811
-about the story.
-Yes.

00:26:11.278 --> 00:26:12.646
I'm curious too.

00:26:12.713 --> 00:26:14.415
You play a character in it,

00:26:14.481 --> 00:26:16.984
so I think you know it earlier than everyone else,

00:26:17.051 --> 00:26:18.352
but I'll say it anyway.

00:26:18.419 --> 00:26:24.124
Popular characters, Leon S. Kennedy, played by Mr. Morikawa,

00:26:24.191 --> 00:26:28.662
and Claire Redfield, are the pivot of the story
that unfolds around them.

00:26:29.163 --> 00:26:30.531
It's a horror action drama.

00:26:30.598 --> 00:26:32.867
When I want to dig deeper now,

00:26:32.933 --> 00:26:35.569
-there are many elements I'm curious about.
-Yes.

00:26:35.636 --> 00:26:36.470
Right?

00:26:36.537 --> 00:26:41.742
The information was released the other day,
you'll know after seeing this.

00:26:41.809 --> 00:26:45.012
One of the stages of the story is the White House.

00:26:45.613 --> 00:26:51.719
That's right. Leon was holding a gun
and rescuing someone just now.

00:26:51.785 --> 00:26:55.823
The scene… the place was the White House.

00:26:55.890 --> 00:26:58.325
I think everyone knows that.

00:26:58.792 --> 00:27:02.963
As far as you can see in the teaser,

00:27:03.030 --> 00:27:05.900
the Western-style building before that…

00:27:05.966 --> 00:27:10.137
The Western-style building, where Claire was,

00:27:10.204 --> 00:27:13.440
and the White House seemed to be the stage,

00:27:13.507 --> 00:27:18.612
but actually, in RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness,

00:27:18.679 --> 00:27:20.581
it's worldwide…

00:27:20.648 --> 00:27:23.884
The stage is set in the whole wide world.

00:27:23.951 --> 00:27:27.121
That's what I hope our viewers will enjoy.

00:27:27.188 --> 00:27:30.257
But no doubt there'll be zombies if it's RESIDENT EVIL.

00:27:30.324 --> 00:27:31.625
-That's right.
-Right?

00:27:31.692 --> 00:27:32.726
-There will be.
-Right?

00:27:32.793 --> 00:27:36.297
If zombies show up in the White House,

00:27:36.363 --> 00:27:38.399
the existence of humans is at risk…

00:27:38.465 --> 00:27:41.268
It is quite serious.

00:27:41.335 --> 00:27:43.003
-Right?
-Yeah.

00:27:43.070 --> 00:27:45.172
What is it, Miss Kohno? You suddenly chuckled.

00:27:45.239 --> 00:27:49.043
Well, I absolutely love the series itself,

00:27:49.109 --> 00:27:51.612
and I've been playing its video games,

00:27:52.146 --> 00:27:54.849
but the moment it becomes a drama…

00:27:55.416 --> 00:27:59.086
What is it? When the zombies attack,

00:27:59.153 --> 00:28:03.390
in a sense, I'm not the player anymore,
so I can watch it objectively.

00:28:03.457 --> 00:28:07.528
I can relax a bit and watch over Leon.

00:28:07.995 --> 00:28:10.397
I can relax and just simply think,

00:28:10.464 --> 00:28:13.033
-"how interesting," so I smiled.
-I see.

00:28:13.100 --> 00:28:17.938
But doesn't it make you nervous
when you watch someone play RESIDENT EVIL?

00:28:18.005 --> 00:28:22.142
You can see the official video
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness.

00:28:22.209 --> 00:28:23.544
That's right.

00:28:23.611 --> 00:28:26.847
There is one more point. Speaking of Leon, you'd think,

00:28:26.914 --> 00:28:29.016
"Wait, did he wear a suit?"

00:28:29.483 --> 00:28:31.352
-You do, right?
-Right?

00:28:31.418 --> 00:28:35.222
Well, actually, in terms of timeline,

00:28:35.289 --> 00:28:38.459
it's several years after Resident Evil 4.

00:28:38.526 --> 00:28:40.895
-Oh, is that so?
-It is.

00:28:40.961 --> 00:28:46.367
That's why he should be working as an agent

00:28:46.834 --> 00:28:49.637
directly under the United States, probably.

00:28:49.703 --> 00:28:52.907
"Probably…" It's "probably" now, right?

00:28:52.973 --> 00:28:54.708
That's what it is.

00:28:54.775 --> 00:28:58.179
I also mentioned this right at the beginning,

00:28:58.245 --> 00:29:01.715
that this is a serial CG animation.

00:29:01.782 --> 00:29:06.487
Since the so-called subscription service
became available in the world,

00:29:06.554 --> 00:29:12.393
serial dramas have been a big hit in the world, right?

00:29:12.459 --> 00:29:14.995
RESIDENT EVIL is now one of them.

00:29:15.062 --> 00:29:20.401
It is the type that makes you want to know what happens next.

00:29:20.467 --> 00:29:23.871
Mr. Morikawa, I think you already got the scripts,

00:29:23.938 --> 00:29:25.806
did they surprise you every time?

00:29:25.873 --> 00:29:28.642
-Actually, I haven't recorded anything.
-What?

00:29:29.276 --> 00:29:30.444
-You haven't?
-No.

00:29:30.511 --> 00:29:33.814
Oh, wow. That means you start at the same place as our viewers…

00:29:33.881 --> 00:29:36.183
-The same. It's the same.
-Wow.

00:29:36.250 --> 00:29:38.452
Well, I know more bits and pieces,

00:29:38.519 --> 00:29:40.454
-but I can't tell you yet.
-You were told.

00:29:40.955 --> 00:29:42.990
-So, above all…
-Yes.

00:29:43.057 --> 00:29:46.560
-You look forward to it as a viewer?
-I'm looking forward to it.

00:29:46.627 --> 00:29:52.933
This title is categorized as survival horror,

00:29:53.000 --> 00:29:55.736
but there are some quite…

00:29:56.670 --> 00:29:59.573
important development in the story too.

00:30:00.341 --> 00:30:03.878
You're going to see the development.

00:30:03.944 --> 00:30:07.314
I hope you'll look forward to it.

00:30:07.381 --> 00:30:12.019
In a sense, a video game commentary by Mr. Morikawa
is going to be streamed.

00:30:12.086 --> 00:30:16.657
I wonder. To me, playing video games is quite difficult,

00:30:16.724 --> 00:30:20.227
so I don't know whether I can do the commentary well or not.

00:30:20.928 --> 00:30:23.564
-But you'll play Leon this time.
-Yes.

00:30:23.631 --> 00:30:25.900
Leon will wear a suit this time.

00:30:25.966 --> 00:30:29.370
Usually… Well, he started as a rookie policeman,

00:30:29.436 --> 00:30:35.242
and if I must say, he adopts a so-called…

00:30:35.309 --> 00:30:36.844
fighting style,

00:30:36.911 --> 00:30:41.949
but I think Leon also looks handsome in his suit,
in a dignified manner.

00:30:42.683 --> 00:30:45.252
It has become even more thrilling.

00:30:45.319 --> 00:30:47.121
If you want to know what the story is,

00:30:47.188 --> 00:30:50.891
Netflix Original Anime Series
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness

00:30:51.358 --> 00:30:54.028
will premier in 2021 worldwide exclusively on Netflix,

00:30:54.528 --> 00:30:59.133
-so please look forward to it this year.
-That's right.

00:30:59.200 --> 00:31:00.734
It's been a blink of an eye,

00:31:00.801 --> 00:31:04.939
and Netflix Anime Mega-rich stage in AnimeJapan 2021
now comes to an end.

00:31:05.005 --> 00:31:08.209
I'd like to ask each of our guests to say a few words.

00:31:08.275 --> 00:31:10.644
-Mr. Tsuda, please.
-Okay, thank you.

00:31:10.711 --> 00:31:13.314
Something has been bothering me.

00:31:13.380 --> 00:31:16.984
Leon has been pointing his gun at Mr. Morikawa the whole time.

00:31:17.852 --> 00:31:18.853
It's true!

00:31:18.919 --> 00:31:21.422
-He's right at that position.
-Yeah.

00:31:21.488 --> 00:31:23.424
He warns me not to give spoilers.

00:31:23.490 --> 00:31:26.360
That's what it is? He'll shoot you if you give any spoiler.

00:31:27.027 --> 00:31:29.296
It's brilliant! Would you zoom in?

00:31:30.965 --> 00:31:32.166
Brilliant.

00:31:32.233 --> 00:31:34.435
Tatsu looks like he'd point a gun at someone.

00:31:34.501 --> 00:31:35.703
Yeah, it's him instead.

00:31:35.769 --> 00:31:39.173
Sorry, I just digressed.

00:31:39.240 --> 00:31:43.110
The Way of the Househusband is really funny,

00:31:43.177 --> 00:31:48.382
it is a useful and really wonderful anime,

00:31:48.449 --> 00:31:51.485
so I hope you would watch it.

00:31:51.552 --> 00:31:53.287
Thank you.

00:31:53.354 --> 00:31:56.090
Thank you. Next, Miss Kohno, please say something.

00:31:56.156 --> 00:32:00.794
Yes. Again, I am Marika Kohno, and I play Sara in Eden.

00:32:00.861 --> 00:32:04.698
As you can see, this is a very precious anime,

00:32:04.765 --> 00:32:06.901
and it is filled with love.

00:32:06.967 --> 00:32:11.639
There are still many mysteries,
please enjoy it together with your family.

00:32:11.705 --> 00:32:13.407
Thank you for today.

00:32:13.474 --> 00:32:17.478
It's the second anime you worked with Mr. Irie, who directed…

00:32:18.212 --> 00:32:19.580
-FullMetal Alchemist.
-Yes.

00:32:19.647 --> 00:32:21.048
It's now an anime I love.

00:32:21.615 --> 00:32:24.752
Please look forward. And Mr. Morikawa, please say something.

00:32:24.818 --> 00:32:31.358
Okay. It will be streamed worldwide
exclusively on Netflix in 2021,

00:32:31.425 --> 00:32:34.461
so RESIDENT EVIL fans all over the world,

00:32:34.528 --> 00:32:39.033
I hope you will enjoy watching

00:32:39.099 --> 00:32:41.602
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness.

00:32:41.669 --> 00:32:43.137
Please be patient!

00:32:43.671 --> 00:32:49.009
It seems nothing was shot out of the gun Leon is holding.

00:32:49.076 --> 00:32:55.883
Many other anime have been announced
as Netflix's original anime this time,

00:32:55.950 --> 00:32:57.418
but please also look forward to

00:32:57.484 --> 00:33:00.621
The Way of the Househusband, Eden,
RESIDENT EVIL: Infinite Darkness.

00:33:00.688 --> 00:33:03.524
On April 4, a Sunday,

00:33:03.591 --> 00:33:09.296
Netflix Anime Mega-Rich 2 Hour Special is scheduled.

00:33:09.363 --> 00:33:15.936
This special program will be streamed
on Netflix Anime's official Twitter

00:33:16.003 --> 00:33:19.940
and Netflix Anime's YouTube channel.

00:33:20.007 --> 00:33:24.078
Details will be released on Netflix Anime's official Twitter anytime,

00:33:24.144 --> 00:33:26.046
please check it out.

00:33:26.113 --> 00:33:31.051
Please enjoy the mega-rich anime on Netflix this spring.

00:33:31.118 --> 00:33:35.523
Everyone, thank you very much
for tuning in early in the morning.

00:33:35.589 --> 00:33:38.492
Would our guest please stand up when we say goodbye,

00:33:38.559 --> 00:33:40.895
and wave your hands?

00:33:40.961 --> 00:33:43.364
Thank you for watching today!

00:33:43.430 --> 00:33:44.665
Thank you!

00:33:44.732 --> 00:33:46.500
Thank you.

